        <item>
            <title>1.5.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:49:47 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://miq.marco-duering.net/</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/marcoduering/MIQ/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>1.5.2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description>&lt;style&gt;
body { line-height: 1.45; margin: 10px 12px; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-size: 1em; font-weight: 600; margin: 14px 0 4px; }
h1:first-child, h2:first-child, h3:first-child, p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
ul, ol { margin: 0 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; }
li { margin: 2px 0; }
code {
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  font-size: 0.92em; background: rgba(128,128,128,.14);
  border-radius: 3px; padding: 1px 4px;
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance improvements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On a network share, the next file's preview no longer waits for the previous file to finish loading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A file shown in both the Finder preview pane and the Quick Look window is loaded only once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closing a preview stops loading or decompressing almost immediately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MRtrix &lt;code class="notranslate"&gt;.mif&lt;/code&gt; masks open noticeably faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With thumbnails enabled, files over 100 MB that would need a full read keep the standard icon instead of slowing down Finder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fixes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;64-bit integer images (int64/uint64) in NIfTI, MIF and NRRD now display instead of failing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improvbed mask detection (some masks rendered as greyscale)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If loading all volumes of a 4D file fails, the Volumes line now says so.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a 1.5.1 regression that could distort volumes with extremely small voxel sizes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Images with very small intensity values (e.g. ADC maps in SI units) display with better contrast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The other views no longer show outdated images when scrolling right after adjusting window/level or loading a 4D file's volumes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/marcoduering/MIQ/releases/download/v1.5.2/MIQ.app.zip" length="4314029" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="L43aXHpGawb+ojhz9g/kZ6kQWafLGch85abtlMI167V+wAFCTy90wtcVcmk+rqtHHLD5GdSbNZOk5/T+bDT0Ag==" />
